{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Milgram Experiment is based on one of the most controversial experiments in the world of psychology. It is a mix of that study and The Trolley Problem. You, the player will step into the shoes of an unwilling subject who's moral choices are tested and explored by a mysterious authority. Your decisions on who to kill or spare will directly effect the outcome of the game and your fate. A psychological thriller of a game with an eerie and aesthetically pleasing levels for you to explore! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PLEASE WISHLIST THE GAME NOW!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719670/extras/f596ae4304c5879656c6f8f5d00c41fd.poster.avif?t=1764258350\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719670/extras/f596ae4304c5879656c6f8f5d00c41fd.webm?t=1764258350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719670/extras/f596ae4304c5879656c6f8f5d00c41fd.mp4?t=1764258350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Player choice matters;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Exploration;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Aesthetically pleasing atmosphere; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Immersive and unique visuals;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dark humor;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Secret lore;\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719670/extras/0a11547240e6c0c24ff7262e657676aa.poster.avif?t=1764258350\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719670/extras/0a11547240e6c0c24ff7262e657676aa.webm?t=1764258350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719670/extras/0a11547240e6c0c24ff7262e657676aa.mp4?t=1764258350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Disclaimer:</i></strong><i> This game\u00a0is a work of fiction inspired by real psychological studies, including the historical Milgram experiment. This game is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or associated with Stanley Milgram, his estate, Yale University, or any official representation of the actual experiment. All characters, events, and scenarios in this game are fictional.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2719670?t=1764258350","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719670/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764258350","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719670/896c3bfb1abf0b7d0d7e95b5bf1e07a1723ceffd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764258350","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719670/896c3bfb1abf0b7d0d7e95b5bf1e07a1723ceffd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764258350","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Milgram Experiment is based on one of the most controversial experiments in the world of psychology. It is a mix of that study and The Trolley Problem. You, the player will step into the shoes of an unwilling subject who's moral choices are tested and explored by a mysterious authority. Your decisions on who to kill or spare will directly effect the outcome of the game and your fate. A psychological thriller of a game with an eerie and aesthetically pleasing levels for you to explore! </p><p class=\"bb_paragra